OL,3,GNEWSAWhy did Courteeners frontman buy
OL,4,Atickets to his own gig?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe street outside legendary indie club
OL,7,F42s, a front garden on Burnage Lane and
OL,8,Fa pub's function room with a tiny stage
OL,9,F- all locations in Manchester where you
OL,10,Fcould have found Courteeners in their
OL,11,Fearly days.
OL,13,FThe four school friends from Middleton,
OL,14,Fnear Rochdale, have certainly come a
OL,15,Flong way since they hit the Manchester
OL,16,Findie scene in 2006.
OL,18,FWhile they have travelled around the
OL,19,Fworld ever since, there is no place
OL,20,Flike home and they will take to the
OL,21,Fstage later for a huge homecoming gig
OL,22,Fat Wythenshawe Park.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
